  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>⚠注意事項</strong>：自2026年1月8日起，Heycronus團隊的所有專案將僅透過CurseForge、Modrinth及Planet Minecraft平台上的devHeycronus帳號正式發布與維護。</p><p>No Pumpkin Blur是一款Minecraft材質包，可降低頭戴南瓜時的模糊效果，讓視野更清晰、干擾更少。透過這個改動，您可以在不嚴重阻礙視線的情況下佩戴南瓜，方便探索與戰鬥。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fbusiness%253dLAEZJ6TS7CYP6%2526no_recurring%253d0%2526item_name%253dHelp%2bme%2bcontinue%2bwith%2bthe%2bprojects%2bwith%2ba%2bsimple%2bdonation%2b-%2bHeycronus%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"font-weight:400;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1013293/description_41c410a1-3705-48e1-9d6d-faca354f3234.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"93\"></a></p><p>- 降低頭戴南瓜時的模糊效果。<br>- 使用南瓜時提供更清晰、更乾淨的視野。<br>- 適合想要保留外觀又不影響遊戲體驗的玩家。</p><p>此材質靈感來自Vanilla Tweaks材質包，並由Heycronus進行修改</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1291/574/sem-tatulo-2-png.png\"></p>",
